","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"American (New), Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1}],"text":[{"business_id":"FPnxRASuezpmN6nG_XTeVg","review_id":"YWo9WulkyAYMZS6xcxT3sg","date":"2019-08-23T18:26:26","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9152888059616089,"text_excerpt":"Five stars Easily. So this particular zpot is real laid back. Outside looks chill. Inside th is spot is a bit small but let me tell yah this....how they were abke to fit a bar and cigar spot in here i dont know. So i appreciate the cleverness of the way this spot was made. So i came here with some co workers so i was a tad bit skeptical. The hist informed us of the $10 steak plates available for lunch only. I really thought it would be some small and thin cut hanger steaks and skampy potatoes. However, it really was not. I prdered mines medium well and i must say he made a good selection. My steak was nice,thick,juicy and even had the grilled smokey flavor i enjoy. It was seasoned really ..."},{"business_id":"FPnxRASuezpmN6nG_XTeVg","review_id":"Q4bYvW9GLV7sWULnIEtAaA","date":"2019-05-02T18:42:03","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9059142470359802,"text_excerpt":"Instantly became one of my favorite cigar spots. Wide selection of cigars and great price points. It is a relaxing environment you can have a meeting, grab lunch or just socialize. Not sure what the title of the person whom assists with your cigar purchase is. But he was one of the most knowledgeable persons in that area I've met. He was able to educate me regarding the tobacco leaves and the various flavors a cigar has."},{"business_id":"FPnxRASuezpmN6nG_XTeVg","review_id":"vbEoxVLx8s12FYqbxIRDpg","date":"2019-01-13T13:05:45","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9029282927513123,"text_excerpt":"Listen...I've had a lot of wings! You need to get here the jerk fried wings and the patio! The wings are fried to perfection with a hint of the Caribbean with the jerk spices. It is served with a side of cool ranch dressing for dipping the fresh, hot wings. It's good place to eat, drink, and hang out for Saints games. If you smoke cigars, they have that too! But don't worry the patio is for cigars."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"FPnxRASuezpmN6nG_XTeVg","photo_id":"sNbwV51izM8synE2S0PeXg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/sNbwV51izM8synE2S0PeXg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9666943550109863},{"business_id":"FPnxRASuezpmN6nG_XTeVg","photo_id":"5sPup8NFkainAtf7SR0Hzg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/5sPup8NFkainAtf7SR0Hzg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9565585851669312},{"business_id":"FPnxRASuezpmN6nG_XTeVg","photo_id":"kx7YGEjsspnhlM4xKMaGqA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/kx7YGEjsspnhlM4xKMaGqA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9086595773696899}]},"notebook_case":null}
